# Explore design system

Use tokens from `src/config/exploreTheme.ts`. Do not invent one-off radii or emerald-on-everything.

## Shapes

| Role | Token / class |
|------|----------------|
| Pills (filters, FAB chrome) | `EXPLORE_SHAPE.pill` → `rounded-full` |
| Controls (inputs, peek cards) | `EXPLORE_SHAPE.control` → `rounded-2xl` |
| Sheet top (mobile) | `EXPLORE_SHAPE.sheetTop` → `rounded-t-3xl` |
| Sheet handle | `EXPLORE_SHAPE.sheetHandle` |

## Colors (4 roles)

1. **Brand chrome** — emerald (`EXPLORE_BRAND_ACTIVE`): Browse, default filters, primary CTAs
2. **Type** — hiking/emerald, camping/amber, rideshare/sky, events/violet, shops/rose
3. **Intent** — Add/rose (`EXPLORE_INTENT.add`), Request/teal (`EXPLORE_INTENT.request`)
4. **State** — errors/red, warnings/amber, success/emerald

Map and list filter pills share type colors via `exploreMapFilterActiveClass`, `exploreActivityListFilterActiveClass`, `exploreVenueListFilterActiveClass`.

## Sheets & peek cards

- **Browse / create flows** → `ExploreResponsiveSheet` (one primitive)
- **Map selection** → `ExploreMapPeekCard` + `ExploreMapPeekPosition` (same silhouette for venues and activities)
- Do not add a third sheet wrapper

## Dropdowns

Never use native `<select>`. Use `AppSelect` from `src/components/ui/AppSelect.tsx`.

## Map ↔ list filters

When changing map filters, sync list filters via `mapFilterToActivityListFilter` / `mapFilterToVenueListFilter` in `exploreRouting.ts`. Reverse sync via `activityFilterToMapFilter` / `venueFilterToMapFilter`.

Non-`all` map filters auto-open the browse sheet on mobile.

## Map pins

Use `exploreMapPinRingColor(kind, source)` for pin ring colors. Clusters use brand emerald ring.

## Peek cards

Include `coverImage` on `ExploreCardModel` when the item has a photo — rendered as a 2:1 strip at the top of `ExploreMapPeekCard`.

## Browse list rows

Use `coverImage` for a 56px thumbnail with a small type emoji overlay; fall back to `ExploreCardTypeBadge` when no photo.

## Terminology

User-facing: **Venues** (not Locations). Internal: `panel=venues`, `source: 'venue'`.
